 "law": "Lag (1997:1137) om vägavgift för vissa tunga fordon, 5, 10, 11 and 23 §§; amounts in kronor for 2026 from Förordning (2025:918): a time-based charge per calendar day, week, month or year for trucks and combinations of 12 t or more, by axles (at most 3, at least 4), CO2 emission class and, in CO2 class 1, EURO class. A foreign truck pays per day of use; a Swedish one pays yearly. The table keeps the daily amount. Not subject to VAT.",
